_3D.ShowConnections [SimTalk]
Shows Connectors/Interfaces/Markers in the active Frame window designated by <Path> (true) or hides
them (false).
Remarks
_3D.ShowConnections shows or hides material flow directions of the length-oriented objects for which
you set _3D.ShowMaterialFlowDirection to true.
Type
Attribute
Syntax
<Path>._3D.ShowConnections:boolean
Assignment Value
You can assign a value of data type boolean.
Example
